WEBVTT

00:00:03.249 --> 00:00:10.395
Limits holds Maximum callers waiting with its Queue-full action, and Maximum wait with its Maximum-wait action.

00:00:10.395 --> 00:00:14.792
Overflow moves the caller to the next queue they have not visited.

00:00:14.792 --> 00:00:18.029
Send to voicemail ends the wait with a message.

00:00:18.554 --> 00:00:24.469
Voicemail can be delivered to an agent's inbox, or to the queue's shared voicemail box.

00:00:24.469 --> 00:00:29.494
Interaction Center, Shared voicemail is where the shared box is reviewed.

